  <item>
    <title>让一切穿过身体</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657f8bad3d5d24e9cb48f57d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657f8bad3d5d24e9cb48f57d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 18 Dec 2023 00:00:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>前两天和</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/609fa245530b2e534b38215c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/609fa245530b2e534b38215c"><span>Eric</span></a><span>在外面露营，聊到半夜，第二天一早看日出。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FljQPDHODMNLfp_QR3T-KF2Psmtg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这是我今年第二次来清迈，这次的聊天氛围不太一样。临时录一期播客，想把它记录下来。这期播客是我一个人说，是我的内心独白，主要讲到：</span></p><span></span><p><span>1）让一切穿过身体。为什么录这期播客？</span></p><span></span><p><span>2）真诚一点，不要骗自己。有人愿意跟你说是好事，那就好好听着。</span></p><span></span><p><span>3）焦虑和冲突有什么好处？</span></p><span></span><p><span>4）多做一步，多想一想。</span></p><span></span><p><span>5）做什么不重要，问题是你想成为什么样的人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你能听完。</span></p><span></span><p><span>里面提到：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ee26c84675a08411f51570" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ee26c84675a08411f51570"><span>播客《无人知晓》E10 让万物穿过自己</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tbsQu9D6tjSu_qZvLlxNeA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tbsQu9D6tjSu_qZvLlxNeA"><span>Eric公众号：英语学习笔记</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>The Surrender Experiment: My Journey into Life’s Perfection</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>The 7 Habits of Highly Effective People</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>The Road to Character</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvmw6_L_vBEgsbQrEK2-LBWon34o.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lteZiRwPFaopu65xiHCMscuwIaHM.m4a" length="14565079" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:37</itunes:duration>
