    <pubDate>Sat, 13 May 2023 14:51:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="48">00:48</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="110">01:50</a> 小咪老师介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="111">01:51</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="586">09:46</a> 为什么说自己是教英语的体育老师？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">09:47</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="966">16:06</a> 你是如何学好英语的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="967">16:07</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a> 社交媒体时代，学语言需要注意什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1123">18:43</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1985">33:05</a> 你是如何学好英文写作的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 主动reach out的勇气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2272">37:52</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2490">41:30</a> 做完《小屁孩日记》课程，是什么感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2496">41:36</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 为什么会做一对一定制课？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2706">45:06</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2799">46:39</a> 小咪老师的社交平台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2917">48:37</a> 我做播客的意义/我们聊完后的感受</span></p><span></span><p><span>Eric公众号：英语学习笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>Justin公众号：孟庆伟英文写作</span></p><span></span><p><span>小咪老师公众号：刘小咪学英语</span></p><span></span><p><span>小咪老师个人账号：小咪Young（微博/B站/小红书/小宇宙）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Ethan账号：Ethan雅思口语（B站/小红书）</span></p>]]></description>
