  <item>
    <title>从重庆到清迈，我和关注七年的英语博主聊了些什么？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644406e23d2b2ce0bdb1e4f9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644406e23d2b2ce0bdb1e4f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 22 Apr 2023 16:10:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾是我的博主朋友张海露Eric，他是公众号【英语学习笔记】和播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/609fa245530b2e534b38215c" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/609fa245530b2e534b38215c"><span>【How to English】</span></a><span>的主理人，可能也是国内最独特的英语博主之一。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 【打破常规】节目和嘉宾Eric介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> Eric回答：你觉得什么是英语好？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 如何在语言学习中提升自信，培养学习习惯，调整心态？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 语言学习初期，高效搭建框架、寻找高质量反馈是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="449">07:29</a> 从零开始学英语，目标驱动是关键</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 钟道隆【逆向学习法】介绍，把一件小事情做好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 社交媒体时代，学会模仿学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="738">12:18</a> 英语高手遇到瓶颈，如何调整心态？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> Eric的自我怀疑，来自于哪里？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 英语学习如何确定正确的目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">21:55</a> 自我怀疑其实是保护机制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> Eric社群里的更加主动和pay it forward，来自于哪里？ &nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">30:10</a> 如何变得更加主动？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Justin公众号：孟庆伟英文写作</span></p><span></span><p><span>提到书籍：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Meet Your Happy Chemicals</span></p><span></span><p><span>Rejection Proof</span></p><span></span><p><span>《被讨厌的勇气》</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Subtle Art of Not Giving a F*ck&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
